WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.710
 What's up Marvel fans?

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.920
I am here with Benedict Wong.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:03.720
How are you?

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:04.520
 Hello, hello.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.410
Ecstatic, excited, bit tired.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:11.040
Bleary eyed from
five AM work call.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.320
But as soon as I get in there--

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.950
Well, these are waking
me up as well, actually.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.460
Oh, it's just fizzing
with excitement, you know?

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:23.440
 It's an exciting
time to be here.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.560
So you've been busy.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.680
Wong has been very
busy in Marvel Studios'

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.009
Shang-Chi the Legend
of the Ten Rings, now

00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:34.380
Spider-Man No Way Home.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:36.060
And not to mention
your upcoming film,

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.700
Doctor Strange in the
Multiverse of Madness.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.010
There's a lot weighing
on Wong's shoulders,

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:42.300
how's he handling it?

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.430
 I'm OK, with aplomb.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:47.730
I got an email from Kevin
Feige saying it's fast becoming

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:51.790
the WCU, so I'll take that.

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:52.950
So here we are.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.580
 The Wong Cinematic Universe.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.380
I like it.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.720
I like it, definitely.

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.280
What is it like to
get a chance to dive

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:03.300
into the Marvel multiverse with
all the weird creative worlds

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:04.709
that it entails?

00:01:04.709 --> 00:01:09.690
 Well we'll certainly have
to do a lot of versions.

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:14.640
And it's also filming as
well, during this time as well

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:17.040
where we're kind of like--

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:20.730
You know, if something
happens then we hit plan B,

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:26.610
we hit plan C. So we're kind
of living in a sort of quantum

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:29.490
filming schedule.

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:31.290
You know, so it's been.

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.400
 That must be
crazy as an actor.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.200
 Yeah.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.370
I mean, I call it "The Madness
of the Multi Schedule."

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:37.170
That's it, really.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:38.640
You know, Doctor Strange that.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.410
 Well, before you
leave, what's something

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.480
that you can tell us that
the fans can look forward to?

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.662
Maybe a little tease.

00:01:44.662 --> 00:01:49.470
 Uh, [LAUGHS] Well, you
know, there'll be a shift,

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:53.280
I think, definitely
in this which will,

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.270
hopefully, you know--

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:58.950
We'll see different
responsibilities I think.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:02.300
[MUSIC PLAYING]

